  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Addressing is a decision",
      "items": [
        "Machine lanes never ride the tailnet: builder VMs over mshome.net, physical AM4 over the home LAN",
        "Tailscale is for humans and roaming access only, never in the control loop"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What actually serves",
      "items": [
        "omen-arc is the live inference surface: llama-server on the dual B70s, resident from boot, no cold-start tax",
        "It binds 127.0.0.1:8082, so the builder VMs on the Default Switch cannot reach it at all"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "A port is not capacity",
      "items": [
        "The oxen facade still answers and still lists models, every one ready:false",
        "A port probe and a health check both pass against a rung that cannot emit a token"
      ]
    }
  ]
